<h1>Weekly Playbook</h1>
<div class="dates">My recommendations from the forensic report · Week of Mon 24 Aug -&gt; Fri 28 Aug 2026</div></div>
<p class="pk-intro">Every concrete recommendation from the report, one card each, <b>grouped by when it is safe to do it</b> rather than by which section wrote it. Tap <b>Shadow</b>, <b>Live</b> or <b>Skip</b>. Picks save automatically — when you are done hit <b>Copy my picks</b> or <b>Send to Telegram</b> and they come back to me for the shadow-vs-live conversation. <b>Refuted &amp; exploratory plays cannot go Live</b> until they survive a week in shadow — that guardrail is built in.</p>
<div class="pk-group">📋 THE WHOLE WEEK ON ONE SCREEN</div><p class="pk-blurb">Every recommendation, in the order it is safe to do it. Tap any row to jump to its card.</p><div class="pk-tw"><table class="pk-sum"><thead><tr><th>When</th><th>#</th><th>Recommendation</th><th>£/wk</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=" pk-wfirst"><td class="pk-w pk-w-saturday" rowspan="8">Sat (today)</td><td class="num">1</td><td><a href="#p-timer-the-two-dead-nightlies-0828">Put router_nightly.py and selector_nightly.py on a timer — both have been silently dead for a fortnight</a></td><td class="num">—</td><td><span class="pill v-live">● LIVE</span></td></tr><tr class=""><td class="num">2</td><td><a href="#p-alert-on-router-headless-aborts-0828">★ The router went blind for 3h35m and every health instrument on the box said it was fine</a></td><td class="num">—</td><td><span class="pill v-live">● LIVE</span></td></tr><tr class=""><td class="num">3</td><td><a href="#p-open-hour-watch-must-match-its-unit-0828">Make open_hour_watch.py match its own unit file, or give its prompt header an EXPIRY</a></td><td class="num">—</td><td><span class="pill v-live">● LIVE</span></td></tr><tr class=""><td class="num">4</td><td><a href="#p-rider-off-tape-fills-0828">★★ 74% of the day rider&#x27;s loss this week is a FILL ARTEFACT — every entry is a split order whose residual leg is priced 0.1% adverse, off the tape</a></td><td class="num">—</td><td><span class="pill v-live">● LIVE</span></td></tr><tr class=""><td class="num">5</td><td><a href="#p-rider-hard-flat-sits-on-the-blackout-edge-0828">★★ The day rider&#x27;s 20:40Z hard flat sits on the edge of a recurring gateway blackout with ZERO margin — it cost $1,258 on 21 August</a></td><td class="num">—</td><td><span class="pill v-live">● LIVE</span></td></tr><tr class=""><td class="num">6</td><td><a href="#p-lake-extra-timeframe-files-inflate-bars-0828">★★ The Parquet lake silently blends four extra timeframes into its bars view — 44.4% of July&#x27;s minutes are inflated, and every backtest reads them</a></td><td class="num">—</td><td><span class="pill v-live">● LIVE</span></td></tr><tr class=""><td class="num">7</td><td><a href="#p-router-needs-a-weekend-calendar-0828">Give the router a weekend and holiday check — it armed a gate 38.7 hours before any market opened, on zero bars</a></td><td class="num">—</td><td><span class="pill v-live">● LIVE</span></td></tr><tr class=""><td class="num">8</td><td><a href="#p-both-nightly-scorecards-are-one-sided-0828">Both nightly scorecards only count the modelled side — print realised P&amp;L beside modelled, or stop publishing them</a></td><td class="num">—</td><td><span class="pill v-live">● LIVE</span></td></tr><tr class=" pk-wfirst"><td class="pk-w pk-w-monday" rowspan="4">Mon</td><td class="num">1</td><td><a href="#p-promote-absveto55s-two-sided-0828">Promote abs_veto_55s TWO-SIDED — the only arm on a 79-row board that survived everything</a></td><td class="num">—</td><td><span class="pill v-shadow">◐ SHADOW</span></td></tr><tr class=""><td class="num">2</td><td><a href="#p-router-step-15m-to-5m-0828">★ Attack the 20-minute arm lag — the router&#x27;s dominant error is no longer direction, it is LATENESS</a></td><td class="num">—</td><td><span class="pill v-live">● LIVE</span></td></tr><tr class=""><td class="num">3</td><td><a href="#p-router-must-quote-window-and-family-0828">Make the router quote a WINDOW and a FAMILY whenever it cites the shadow board</a></td><td class="num">—</td><td><span class="pill v-live">● LIVE</span></td></tr><tr class=""><td class="num">4</td><td><a href="#p-untradeable-stop-meter-tournament-only-0828">Filter the untradeable stop-rate meter to tournament gates only — it has never once discriminated</a></td><td class="num">—</td><td><span class="pill v-live">● LIVE</span></td></tr><tr class=" pk-wfirst"><td class="pk-w pk-w-build" rowspan="13">Build</td><td class="num">1</td><td><a href="#p-measure-absveto-short-trigger-lag-0828">★